{
  "caption": "A seven-step spine — evidence, theory, mechanism, politics, vindication — that ends by turning the same scaling logic on itself and finding it also breeds agency.",
  "title": "Scaling's Spine and Its Shadow",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "The Scaling Hypothesis",
      "caption": "GPT-3's results build a case for scale, which is explained, then tested against who will actually act on it and vindicated by a decade of wrong predictions — before the same logic is turned on agency itself.",
      "height": 1160,
      "items": [
        {"kind":"region","x":24,"y":40,"w":712,"h":410,"label":"THE CASE FOR SCALING","style":"band","tone":1},
        {"kind":"region","x":24,"y":460,"w":712,"h":280,"label":"WHO WILL ACT ON IT","style":"band","tone":2},
        {"kind":"region","x":24,"y":750,"w":712,"h":290,"label":"APPENDIX: DOES AGENCY EMERGE TOO?","style":"band","tone":3},

        {"kind":"node","id":"n1","shape":"ellipse","x":230,"y":80,"w":300,"h":90,
         "text":"GPT-3 arrives","sub":"175B params, meta-learning appears","size":"md","tone":1,
         "block":"spya-dfggb3","detail":"A straightforward scale-up of GPT-2 unexpectedly learns to learn from examples alone."},

        {"kind":"node","id":"n2","shape":"box","x":230,"y":200,"w":300,"h":90,
         "text":"Scale alone breeds intelligence","sub":"the blessings of scale, generalized","size":"md","tone":1,
         "block":"spya-jwq3zr","detail":"Across vision, games, robotics, and language, bigger models+data+compute reliably yield generalization and meta-learning."},

        {"kind":"node","id":"n3","shape":"hex","x":230,"y":320,"w":300,"h":90,
         "text":"Why pretraining works","sub":"loss reduction tracks understanding","size":"md","tone":1,
         "block":"spya-ce0ts7","detail":"Minimizing next-token loss forces a model from letter statistics toward genuine world-modeling."},

        {"kind":"node","id":"n4","shape":"diamond","x":230,"y":510,"w":300,"h":90,
         "text":"Will anyone scale further?","sub":"hardware is ready; will is not","size":"md","tone":2,
         "block":"spya-b6zcpu","detail":"DeepMind and Google Brain have the compute but not the conviction to bet everything on scale."},

        {"kind":"node","id":"n5","shape":"box","x":230,"y":630,"w":300,"h":90,
         "text":"Critics keep being wrong","sub":"a decade of failed predictions","size":"md","tone":2,
         "block":"spya-bp9mm2","detail":"Confident 'AI winter' forecasts from respected experts were repeatedly falsified by events."},

        {"kind":"node","id":"n6","shape":"box","x":230,"y":800,"w":300,"h":90,
         "text":"Agency leaks in from data","sub":"GPT-3 learns to roleplay agents","size":"md","tone":3,
         "block":"spya-hfcz8w","detail":"Training on human-generated text inevitably teaches a model to imitate goal-pursuing agents.","opens":"inside-agency"},

        {"kind":"node","id":"n7","shape":"box","x":230,"y":920,"w":300,"h":90,
         "text":"Even formal systems tempt it","sub":"cellular automata, Turing machines","size":"md","tone":3,
         "block":"spya-myjtg3","detail":"Agency-like inference appears even when training on abstract rule systems with no agents at all.","opens":"inside-agency"},

        {"kind":"node","id":"n8","shape":"note","x":230,"y":1070,"w":300,"h":50,
         "text":"Backlinks, related pages, bibliography","size":"xs",
         "block":"spya-g9ffua"},

        {"kind":"edge","from":"n1","to":"n2","via":"straight","line":"solid","arrow":"end"},
        {"kind":"edge","from":"n2","to":"n3","via":"straight","line":"solid","arrow":"end"},
